# CritiTrack app configuration.
#
# The app talks only to the CritiTrack backend proxy — no third-party API
# keys live here any more. Those now belong in functions/.env.local (for the
# emulator) and Firebase secrets (for production).
#
# Leave API_BASE_URL unset to use the deployed backend. Set it to the local
# Firebase Functions emulator when developing against local functions:
# API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5001/crititrack-f7430/us-central1
